    {
      "id": "24ca475e7129-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;SUBTLE&rsquo; is written as &lsquo;40CUMF&rsquo;, &lsquo;HANGER&rsquo; is written as &lsquo;9OHFS&rsquo;, how will &lsquo;CLOTH&rsquo; be written as in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;SUBTLE&rsquo; is written as &lsquo;40CUMF&rsquo;, &lsquo;HANGER&rsquo; is written as &lsquo;9OHFS&rsquo;, how will &lsquo;CLOTH&rsquo; be written as in that language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "17OTH",
          "html": "17OTH&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "15PUI",
          "html": "15PUI"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "17PUI",
          "html": "17PUI"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "15OTH",
          "html": "15OTH&nbsp;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage8602.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;SUBTLE&rsquo; is written as &lsquo;40CUMF&#39;,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/12/F2_SSC_Savita_26-12-23_D%20%2815%29.png\" style=\"width: 224px; height: 115px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;HANGER&rsquo; is written as &lsquo;9OHFS&#39;,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/12/F2_SSC_Savita_26-12-23_D%20%2816%29.png\" style=\"width: 222px; height: 113px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Similarly, for &#39;<strong>CLOTH</strong>&#39;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/12/F2_SSC_Savita_26-12-23_D%20%2817%29.png\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 114px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So,&nbsp;&#39;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">CLOTH</span>&#39; is written as &#39;<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">15PUI</span></strong>&#39;.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 2&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage8602.png",
